  "body_text": "Equipment\nTriple pump\n        Three separate parallel filters with Waterra capsules\n \n\nInlet hose size: 12 mm or 4 mm diameter\n \n\nMaximum height between the water surface and the pump: \n1.5 m with 12 mm diameter hoses and 5 m with 4 mm diameter hose (model 1)\n3 m with 12 mm diameter hoses and 15 m with 6 mm diameter hose (model 2)\n \nEffective pumping speed: 3 L/min (model 1) or 10 L/min (model 2)\n \n\nThree integrated flow meters\n \n\n8-hour battery life (model 1) or 10-hour battery life (model 2) with included Opti Battery lithium-ion battery\n \n\nPore size: 0.1 µm, 0.22 µm, 0.45 µm, 1.2 µm, and 5 µm\n            StickPump\n        \nFour filters operating in parallel\nPumping rate: 40 L/min\nIntegrated flow meter\nMakita 18V battery (not included)\n20 µm nylon filters, 47 mm diameter\n    \n            Yellow Submarine\n        \n        Three parallel filtration channels\nVacuum-assisted filtration; filtered volume depends on towing speed (approximately 50 L per filter in 10 minutes at 6 knots)\n20 µm nylon filters, 47 mm diameter\nDesigned to be towed behind a boat\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/services__equipment.json"
